# Hostinger deploy

When the user asks to deploy, upload, publish, or update VVR on Hostinger:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/hostinger-vvr-deploy/SKILL.md` and follow its checklist.
2. Use fixed domain and build settings from `.cursor/skills/hostinger-vvr-deploy/REFERENCE.md`.
3. Use the **user-hostinger** MCP server; do not guess hPanel clicks if the API can do the step.
4. Never write upload auth keys or API tokens into the repo or skills.
5. After a successful deploy, verify `https://vvr.ibrahimbilal.com/api/health`.
